== Usage ==
<pre>
{{Timeline
|{{Timeline item |date=1612 |title=The Go academy |text=The Tokugawa shogunate patronises the game.}}
{{Timeline item |date=c. 1651 |title=Huang Longshi |text=Born. |image=Huang Longshi.jpg |caption=Huang Longshi}}
