</pre>

== Notes ==
* Items are separated by newlines inside parameter 1; if an item text contains "=", it is fine because named params are used.
* Styles live in <code>Template:Timeline/styles.css</code>, copied from <code>prototype/timeline.css</code>.
* Needs <code>#if</code> (ParserFunctions) on the host wiki.
